* Physical AI - Experiment 16 architecture I: current-mode invert-and-sum, unbuffered compensated dividers
* Passive inverting amplifiers (R ratio) create -Vin. One 0 V summing node per neuron. One current dump onto physical R_IV. Fine taps load-compensated, no isolation buffer. No dual CCCS.
* Frozen Experiment 9 network A. Weights were not edited.
* Behavioral circuit analysis. Not transistor-level or PCB power.
* invert A=100000 R_INV=10000 Ileak=0 rail=15 linear=False vos=0
* shape: 2 -> 4 -> 1

